ns of countries.","resource_type":"Related Material","url":null,"website_url":"https://openknowledge.worldbank.org/handle/10986/17414","format":"HTML","harvest_source":"https://openknowledge.worldbank.org/handle/10986/17414","harvest_system_reference":"https://openknowledge.worldbank.org/handle/10986/17414","harvest_system":null,"distribution_size":null,"rFormat":"report","isDownload":false,"constraintsSecurityException":"","rVersion":"","rVersionDate":"","exception":"","licenseInfo":"","rCountry":[],"rLanguagesSupported":[],"rSpatialResolution":"","rTemporalStart":"","rTemporalEnd":"","rTemporalResolution":"","rMaintenanceFrequency":"","rMaintenanceNote":"","hasMetaData":true},{"resource_id":"66f25299-37c8-eb11-bacc-000d3a5a1c19","resource_unique_id":"DR0046608","name":"Measuring Rural Access : Update 2017/18","description":"Building on the methodology developed under the first phase of RAI effort, this update includes results for an additional 15 countries, at both the national and subnational level. ","resource_type":"Publication","url":null,"website_url":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/543621569435525309/World-Measuring-Rural-Access-Update-2017-18","format":"PDF","harvest_source":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/543621569435525309/World-Measuring-Rural-Access-Update-2017-18","harvest_system_reference":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/543621569435525309/World-Measuring-Rural-Access-Update-2017-18","harvest_system":null,"distribution_size":null,"rFormat":"report","isDownload":false,"constraintsSecurityException":"","rVersion":"","rVersionDate":"","exception":"","licenseInfo":"","rCountry":[],"rLanguagesSupported":[],"rSpatialResolution":"","rTemporalStart":"","rTemporalEnd":"","rTemporalResolution":"","rMaintenanceFrequency":"","rMaintenanceNote":"","hasMetaData":true},{"resource_id":"d0de34a0-37c8-eb11-bacc-000d3a5a1c19","resource_unique_id":"DR0046610","name":"Spatial Analysis of Liberia's Transport Connectivity and Potential Growth","description":"Report on Liberia's Transport connectivity, utilizing RAI results and derived analysis.","resource_type":"Related Material","url":null,"website_url":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/645891528880914571/Spatial-Analysis-of-Liberia-s-Transport-Connectivity-and-Potential-Growth","format":"PDF","harvest_source":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/645891528880914571/Spatial-Analysis-of-Liberia-s-Transport-Connectivity-and-Potential-Growth","harvest_system_reference":"https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/645891528880914571/Spatial-Analysis-of-Liberia-s-Transport-Connectivity-and-Potential-Growth","harvest_system":null,"distribution_size":null,"rFormat":"report","isDownload":false,"constraintsSecurityException":"","rVersion":"","rVersionDate":"","exception":"","licenseInfo":"","rCountry":[],"rLanguagesSupported":[],"rSpatialResolution":"","rTemporalStart":"","rTemporalEnd":"","rTemporalResolution":"","rMaintenanceFrequency":"","rMaintenanceNote":"","hasMetaData":true},{"resource_id":"dbde34a0-37c8-eb11-bacc-000d3a5a1c19","resource_unique_id":"DR0046611","name":"Rural Access Index (RAI) Supplemental Guidelines (ReCAP Publication)","description":"This document contains supplemental guidelines to the 2016 RAI methodology (World Bank, 2016). These supplemental guidelines contain detailed, step-by-step procedures for calculation, documentation and publication of RAI (SDG 9.1.1) for a country. They follow the key tenets of the 2016 methodology, emphasizing the involvement of National Statistical Offices (NSOs) and government agencies in the process, and providing transparency and consistency in how the RAI is calculated. These guidelines also provide an alternative approach to the ‘all-season’ aspect of RAI for instances of limited data availability, by focusing on the intended purpose of the road network and the changing risks of accessibility to that network, rather than relying on physical measurements of road condition. ","resource_type":"Related Material","url":null,"website_url":"https://www.research4cap.org/Library/Workmanetal-TRL-2019-RuralAccessIndexSupplementalGuidelines-ReCAP-GEN2033D-191219-compressed.pdf","format":"PDF","harvest_source":"https://www.research4cap.org/Library/Workmanetal-TRL-2019-RuralAccessIndexSupplementalGuidelines-ReCAP-GEN2033D-191219-compressed.pdf","harvest_system_reference":"https://www.research4cap.org/Library/Workmanetal-TRL-2019-RuralAccessIndexSupplementalGuidelines-ReCAP-GEN2033D-191219-compressed.pdf","harvest_system":null,"distribution_size":null,"rFormat":"pdf","isDownload":true,"constraintsSecurityException":"","rVersion":"","rVersionDate":"","exception":"","licenseInfo":"","rCountry":[],"rLanguagesSupported":[],"rSpatialResolution":"","rTemporalStart":"","rTemporalEnd":"","rTemporalResolution":"","rMaintenanceFrequency":"","rMaintenanceNote":"","hasMetaData":true},{"resource_id":"4646cfa6-37c8-eb11-bacc-000d3a5a1c19","resource_unique_id":"DR0046614","name":"UAE - RAI results","description":"United Arab Emirates - RAI Calculation methodology and results ","resource_type":"Documentation","url":null,"website_url":"https://sdgsuae-fcsa.opendata.arcgis.com/datasets/9-1-1-proportion-of-the-rural-population-who-live-within-2-km-of-an-all-season-road?geometry=42.375%2C22.607%2C65.590%2C26.109","format":"","harvest_source":"https://sdgsuae-fcsa.opendata.arcgis.com/datasets/9-1-1-proportion-of-the-rural-population-who-live-within-2-km-of-an-all-season-road?geometry=42.375%2C22.607%2C65.590%2C26.109","harvest_system_reference":"https://sdgsuae-fcsa.opendata.arcgis.com/datasets/9-1-1-proportion-of-the-rural-population-who-live-within-2-km-of-an-all-season-road?geometry=42.375%2C22.607%2C65.590%2C26.109","harvest_system":null,"distribution_size":null,"rFormat":"html","isDownload":false,"constraintsSecurityException":"","rVersion":"","rVersionDate":"","exception":"","licenseInfo":"","rCountry":[],"rLanguagesSupported":[],"rSpatialResolution":"","rTemporalStart":"","rTemporalEnd":"","rTemporalResolution":"","rMaintenanceFrequency":"","rMaintenanceNote":"","hasMetaData":true}],"Indicators":[],"Citation":[]},"collections":[{"collection_id":"3","collection_code":"BOOST_PUBLIC_EXPENDITURE","collection_title":"BOOST - Public Expenditure Database","collection_description":"The BOOST initiative is a Bank-wide collaborative effort launched in 2010 to facilitate access to budget data and promote effective use for improved decision-making processes, transparency and accountability.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/boost-logo-11.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-boost-logo-11.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:14 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"11","collection_code":"COVID_19","collection_title":"Coronavirus (COVID-19) Related Datasets","collection_description":"This collection contains datasets that may be useful for analysis, response or modelling for the Coronavirus (COVID-19) pandemic.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Covid_datasets1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-covid_datasets1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:28 AM","modified_on":"","dataset_count":29},{"collection_id":"30","collection_code":"DATA360","collection_title":"Data 360","collection_description":"The Data360 initiative aims to integrate high-value data and knowledge curated in the Bank’s verticals into a user-centered data platform. ","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/data360_thumbnail_img.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/data360_img.jpg","created_on":"7/30/2024 4:22:51 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"9","collection_code":"DEVELOPMENT_DATA_PARTNERSHIP","collection_title":"Development Data Partnership","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Development Data Partnership platform facilitates formation of public-private partnerships for solving development challenges with technology. Specifically, the Development Data Partnership Working Group organizes opportunities for WBG staff to work with technology companies who offer pro-bono data and resources.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/development-data-partnership-400px1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_development-data-partnership-400px1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:26 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"28","collection_code":"DISC_INDEX","collection_title":"Discrepancy Index","collection_description":"This collection contains discrepancy indexes for UN COMTRADE data that aims to capture both the frequency of missed reporting and its impact on overall recorded trade value","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Black.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Black.jpg","created_on":"8/29/2023 5:57:17 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"4","collection_code":"EARTH_OBSERVATION_SUSTAINABLE","collection_title":"Earth Observation for Sustainable Development","collection_description":"A collection of datasets produced through partnership between the World Bank and the European Space Agency (ESA) Earth Observation for Sustainable Development (EO4SD) initiative.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/cropped-eo4sd_main-250x1501.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/cropped-eo4sd_main-270x2701.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:22 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"5","collection_code":"ENERGY_DATA","collection_title":"Energy Data Info","collection_description":"Open data and analytics for a sustainable energy future.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WB_Energy_Datasets1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_WB_Energy_Datasets1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:23 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"17","collection_code":"EQUITABLE_GROWTH","collection_title":"Equitable Growth, Finance and Institutions","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThis collection features datasets to support building policies, institutions and investments for inclusive and sustainable growth.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/efi1.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-efi1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:33 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"27","collection_code":"GENDERSPATIAL","collection_title":"Gender Spatial Data - Small Island States","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eProject Page: https://worldbank.github.io/GEEST/README.html \u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAs part of the “Geospatial Assessment of Women Employment and Business Opportunities in the Energy Sector” project, open-source Gender-related spatial data was collected for 31 Small Island Developing States (SIDS) across the globe, resulting in curated and thoroughly documented geodatabases (GDBs) that are now ready to be explored! \nFifty-nine spatial layers were identified and then researched for each country, covering the following categories: Demographics and Population | Renewable Energy | Energy Access | Education | Jobs and Finance | Digital Inclusion | Transportation | Safety | Amenities | Climate/Earth | Law/Policy/Government. \n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\nHowever, not every country GDB contains all 59 data layers, as this was dependent on the availability of open-source data in each SIDS. Users are encouraged to check the accompanying metadata excel file for more information on the datasets in each GDB, the vintage, and the ","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published-v2/ui-elements/collection/GenderSpatial.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published-v2/ui-elements/collection/GenderSpatial.png","created_on":"2/16/2023 7:07:07 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"1","collection_code":"GEOSPATIAL","collection_title":"Geospatial Datasets","collection_description":"A collection of datasets that contain geospatial data. These datasets have one or more resources in a geospatial data format.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Geospatial1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-Geospatial1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 10:08:47 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"6","collection_code":"IMF","collection_title":"IMF Dataset","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eCollection of useful datasets from IMF made available to Bank staff via \u003ca href=http://mydatabank.worldbank.org\u003emyDataBank\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/imf11.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_imf11.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:24 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"12","collection_code":"INFRASTRUCTURE_FINANCE_DATASETS","collection_title":"Infrastructure Finance Datasets","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of datasets to help finance the global infrastructure gap.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Infrastructure_Finance1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_infrastructure_Finance1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:29 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"20","collection_code":"LIBRARY","collection_title":"Library Databases","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eData and dataset subscriptions managed by the Library Network on agriculture, business, economics, energy, finance, health, risk, water, and more..\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/search_library_databases1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/wbg-library-ddh-collection.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:37 AM","modified_on":"","dataset_count":2},{"collection_id":"13","collection_code":"LINKEDIN_DATA","collection_title":"LinkedIn Data for Development","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThe LinkedIn-World Bank partnership offers data to help governments and researchers understand rapidly evolving labor markets with detailed and dynamic data. It allows leaders to benchmark and compare labor markets across the world; analyze skills, occupations, migration, and industries; and leverage real-time data to make policy changes.Visualizations for many of these data are available at \u003ca href=https://linkedindata.worldbank.org/\u003elinkedindata.worldbank.org\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Linkedin1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Linkedin1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:30 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"7","collection_code":"MERCHANDISE_TRADE","collection_title":"Merchandise Trade Data","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eCollection of merchandise trade data available to World Bank staff.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/trade2.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-trade1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:25 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"8","collection_code":"PR_WORKING","collection_title":"Policy Research Working Papers","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThis collection includes datasets associated with research organized under the Bank, \u003ca href=http://prwp.worldbank.org target='_blank' title='Opens in a new window'\u003ePolicy Research Working Papers\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/research-image1.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_research-image1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:26 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"21","collection_code":"RDL","collection_title":"Risk Data Library","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThis collection contains data on disaster and climate risk assessments curated by the Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery (GFDRR).\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/RDL_logo_square1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/RDL_logo_rectangle1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:38 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"29","collection_code":"ROAD_TOOL","collection_title":"Road Software Tools","collection_description":"This collection presents software tools and models developed by the World Bank to support monitoring, planning, programming and the economic evaluation of roads and highways works.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/CN_road_safety_tools_short_banner.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/images.jpg","created_on":"2/9/2024 10:31:09 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"24","collection_code":"SARCE","collection_title":"SARCE Spatial Database","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThis spatial database, a product of the South Asia Region Chief Economist's (SARCE) Office, presents data collected from official sources and harmonized into different spatial levels. Data includes economic and environmental data across 12 topic areas, and includes data from four countries in South Asia (Bangladesh, Bhutan, India, and Nepal) for both 2001 and 2011.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/spatial-data1.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-spatial-data1.jpg","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:40 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"25","collection_code":"SAE_POVERTY_MAPPING","collection_title":"Small area estimates / Poverty mapping","collection_description":"A collection of country Small Area Estimation (SAE) and Poverty Mapping that contains papers, shapefiles, and datasets produced through partnerships between the World Bank and country statistics offices.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/SME_thumbnail.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/SME_collection.png","created_on":"1/19/2023 1:46:58 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"26","collection_code":"SEM","collection_title":"Syria Economic Monitor","collection_description":"This collection consists of datasets compiled and created by the World Bank Data Lab in response to a request by the Syria Economic Monitor Team to explore alternative data sources to better understand changing trends in trade and economic activity, focusing on: surface cross-border transport routes, changes in observed agricultural production, observed nighttime lights, and reported conflict.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/SEM_thumbnail.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/collection.png","created_on":"1/24/2023 8:24:19 PM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"23","collection_code":"UKRAINE","collection_title":"Ukraine datasets","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of relevant datasets to support operations in Ukraine.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Ukraine1.jpg","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-Ukraine1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:39 AM","modified_on":"","dataset_count":170},{"collection_id":"10","collection_code":"WBG_ESA","collection_title":"World Bank (WBG) - European Space Agency (ESA) Database","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eCatalogue lists all the data produced under the partnership contracts between the World Bank Group and the European Space Agency\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/search-wb-esa-pic1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/search-wb-esa-pic1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:27 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"14","collection_code":"WB_DIGITAL","collection_title":"World Bank Digital Development Data","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of datasets to help achieve universal access to reliable and fast internet services for all.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WB_digital_developmentdata1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_WB_digital_developmentdata1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:31 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"15","collection_code":"WB_ENERGY","collection_title":"World Bank Energy Datasets","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of datasets to help achieve sustainable energy for all.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WB_Energy_Datasets1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_WB_Energy_Datasets1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:32 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"16","collection_code":"WB_TRANSPORT","collection_title":"World Bank Transport Data","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of datasets to help achieve sustainable mobility for all.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/Transport_data1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_transport_data1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:32 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"2","collection_code":"WB_WATER","collection_title":"World Bank Water Data","collection_description":"From Data to a Water-Secure World for All. World Bank Water Data surrounding the three pillars of Sustain Water Resources, Deliver Services and Build Resilience.","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/gwsp-color-horizontal1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner_gwsp-color-horizontal1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 10:26:57 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"19","collection_code":"WDR","collection_title":"World Development Report 2021","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives\u003c/b\u003e explores the tremendous potential of the changing data landscape to improve the lives of poor people, while also acknowledging its potential to open back doors that can harm individuals, businesses, and societies. To address this tension between the helpful and harmful potential of data, this Report calls for a new social contract that enables the use and reuse of data to create economic and social value, ensures equitable access to that value, and fosters trust that data will not be misused in harmful ways. The data used in the WDR2021 are curated as a collection here.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WDR-Collection1.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WDR-Collection1.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:36 AM","modified_on":""},{"collection_id":"22","collection_code":"WDR2022","collection_title":"World Development Report 2022","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ci\u003eWorld Development Report 2022: Finance for an Equitable Recovery\u003c/i\u003e examines the central role of finance in the economic recovery from the COVID-19 pandemic. In doing so, it looks into the consequences of the crisis most likely to affect emerging economies and proposes a set of policies to mitigate the interconnected financial risks stemming from the pandemic and to steer economies toward a sustainable and equitable recovery. The data used in the WDR2022 are curated as a collection here.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/WDR20221.png","detail_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-published/ui-elements/collection/inner-WDR20221.png","created_on":"1/16/2023 11:51:39 AM","modified_on":"","dataset_count":7},{"collection_id":"18","collection_code":"WORLD_SETTLEMENT","collection_title":"World Settlement Footprint","collection_description":"\u003cp\u003eThe World Settlement Footprint Collection includes country datasets describing the evolution of the built-area across the globe at a ~30m resolution.\u003c/p\u003e","list_filename":"https://datacatalogfiles.worldbank.org/ddh-publishe